    - target: {fileID: 6590962177246185031, guid: c1bb0771d0530af4ea1ae7956232b25c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\t\t\t\t\t\tSynthesizers\n   Is like a very precise \u201Cradio tone
        maker\u201D that creates the exact signals airplanes     need to find the
        runway. It generates clean, accurate radio waves at the right frequency,
        so the aircraft\u2019s receiver can follow them safely. In simple terms:
        it makes the \u201Cguiding sound\u201D that tells the airplane \u201Cyou\u2019re
        lined up correctly\u201D or \u201Cmove left or right\u201D as it approaches
        the runway. Synthesizer on the left is for TX1 and right for TX2\r\n\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
